abstract: >-
  A bilingual learning case for nonequilibrium water condensation in a
  CO2-H2O mixture flowing through a supersonic nozzle. Includes UDF source,
  mesh, native Case/Data, exported results, and verification records.
  Physical validation and a Fluent read test of the public native copies
  remain incomplete. The author entry identifies the publishing GitHub
  account. Licensing scopes and third-party exclusions are in LICENSES.md.
